    -- THE BOX AS VARIABLES (2026-09-03): a per-frame walk in another module
    -- reads these directly instead of through pos_x()/box_w() and their
    -- kin - a cross-module variable is a plain memory load, an accessor is a
    -- bank trampoline (~250-1,000 T-cycles a call on the sm83, measured).
    -- The accessors stay for everything that is not per frame. READ ONLY
    -- from outside: every writer is still in this module.
    export px, py, pw, ph
}
